# TODO.md Files

When writing or updating TODO.md files:

- Follow the Markdown Style Guide rule (lines under 79
  characters, ASCII only, prefer `-` for normal bullets).
- Include this legend near the top of the file:

```text
TODO format:
- TODO
o in progress
X Won't Do
* done.
```

## Status markers

Prefix each task line with one of these markers:

| Marker | Meaning      |
|--------|--------------|
| `-`    | TODO         |
| `o`    | in progress  |
| `X`    | Won't Do     |
| `*`    | done         |

## Example

```markdown
# Project TODOs

TODO format:
- TODO
o in progress
X Won't Do
* done.

## Tasks

- Add unit tests for parser
o Wire up CLI flags
* Fix crash on empty input
X Support Python 2
```
